  "hash": 4139916815,
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Hits with the weapon grant ability energy to the most charged ability. Does not require Direct Hits.\n\nDoes not grant any energy to abilities that you already have a full charge of.\n\nAbility energy gains by weapon:\n• VS Pyroelectric Propellant: 0.2% //Adaptive Auto Rifle\n• VS Velocity Baton: 0.365% //Area-Denial Grenade Launcher\n• VS Gravitic Arrest: 0.425% //Adaptive Fusion Rifle\n• VS Chill Inhibitor: 3.5% //Rapid-Fire Grenade Launcher\n\n#ChunkEnergyScalars",
      "updatedAt": "2025-02-03T20:10:32.202Z",
      "updatedBy": "Stardust"
    }
  },
  "associated": [],
  "compendium": {
    "gid": "1662574278",
    "rowKey": "Bray Legacy\n\nVesper's Host Weapons\nDungeon\n\nReclamation Weapons",
    "section": "Origin Traits",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Grants Ability Energy to the most-charged Ability per damage instance. Excludes instances from Explosive Perks/Micro Missiles.\nDoes not grant any Ability Energy to abilities with multiple charges as long as it has 1 Charge. Amount gained decreases as Magazine Size increases.\n\n% Energy Gain at X Magazine Size:\nVesper's Host\nVS Pyroelectric Propellant: 0.22% ↑0.29% at 48 | 0.18% ↑0.23% at 60\nVS Gravitic Arrest: 0.4% ↑0.48% at 6 | 0.3% ↑0.38% at 8\nVS Velocity Baton: 0.32% ↑0.39%\nVS Chill Inhibitor: 5% ↑6.5% at 6 | 3.9% ↑4.8% at 8\n\nReclamation\nAhab Char: 0.2% ↑0.25% at 51 | 0.15% ↑0.19% at 72\nJurisprudent: 0.85% ↑1.05% at 13 | 0.68% ↑0.84% at 16\nFaustus Decline: 0.77% ↑0.96% at 14 | 0.64% ↑0.8% at 17\nShortline Dissident: 2.72% ↑3.42% at 6 | 2.35% ↑2.91% at 7\nEighty-Six: 10.34% ↑13.05%\nHaliaetus: 10.37% ↑13%. Unaffected by Bipod.\n\n↑1.25x Ability Energy Gains.",
